{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902490/extras/62cb2d8ad41e0fdca7b4d87b0e53c20a.poster.avif?t=1757263637\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902490/extras/62cb2d8ad41e0fdca7b4d87b0e53c20a.webm?t=1757263637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902490/extras/62cb2d8ad41e0fdca7b4d87b0e53c20a.mp4?t=1757263637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>A fast-paced first-person platformer with combat and style.</i></strong> Wall-run, jump, slide, and grapple through the skies with mind-melting speed and a set of powerful abilities through diferent dimentions with unique environments and their own music. Master your movement and destroy anything in your path.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902490/extras/d8edabf3e6b45042dc6ac72d44767a09.avif?t=1757263637\" width=616 height=130 /></span><br><u><strong>9+ unique abilities</strong></u> \u2014 from dashes to grabbing enemies and using them as shield with more on their way.<br><br><u><strong>Fierce enemies</strong></u> \u2014 each with their own behavior, movement, and tactics.<br><br><u><i><strong>Insane level design</strong></i></u> \u2014 master intense parkour across mind-bending environments, each with a unique look and feel. No two levels will ever be the same.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902490/extras/da91d61f7b8da88e2a685931d28ee15e.avif?t=1757263637\" data-has-big width=1560 height=529 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap